4. covering squares at positions (0, 1), (1, 1), (1, 2); (2, 1), (2, 2), (1, 3)
5. covering squares at positions (0, 0), (1, 0), (2, 0); (1, 1), (1, 2), (2, 2)
6. covering squares at positions (0, 0), (1, 0), (2, 0); (1, 1), (1, 2), (2, 1)
7. covering squares at positions (0, 0), (1, 0), (1, 1); (2, 0), (2, 1), (2, 2) (this is equivalent to piece )

